## 4.  Complexity Analysis

| Step | Time | Space |
|------|------|-------|
| Phase 1 (candidate selection) | **O(n)** | **O(1)** |
| Phase 2 (verification, optional) | **O(n)** | **O(1)** |
| **Total** | **O(n)** | **O(1)** |

If you’re certain that a majority element always exists (as many interview problems state), you can skip the verification step and keep the function to a single pass.

